---

<BaseLayout
  title="Spaghetti Meter - The most important score in software"
  description="Compete for the highest Spaghetti Meter score, defeat your friends, impress your boss, and become a certified pasta engineer. Obviously serious."
  favicon="/spaghetti.svg"
  bodyClass="spaghetti-page"
>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(softwareJsonLd)}></script>
  <meta slot="head" property="og:title" content="Spaghetti Meter - The most important score in software" />
  <meta slot="head" property="og:description" content="A playful local desktop app powered by Code Buster 0.14.3. Download Spaghetti Meter 0.1.1 for macOS ARM64, Linux x86_64, or Windows x86_64." />
  <meta slot="head" property="og:url" content="https://toolbunker.dev/spaghetti-meter/" />
  <meta slot="head" property="og:image" content="https://toolbunker.dev/spaghetti.svg" />
  <link slot="head" rel="canonical" href="https://toolbunker.dev/spaghetti-meter/" />
  <style>
    :global(.spaghetti-page) {
      --spaghetti-primary: #ff3b1f;
      --spaghetti-secondary: #00e5ff;
      --spaghetti-accent: #8b5cf6;
      --spaghetti-highlight: #ffd800;
      --spaghetti-green: #58f06f;
      --spaghetti-night: #0d0824;
      --spaghetti-panel: #17103a;
      --spaghetti-panel-strong: #251458;
      --spaghetti-cream: #fff8dd;
      --spaghetti-body: #d8d0f0;
      --spaghetti-muted: #aaa0c8;
      --spaghetti-on-primary: #150904;
      --spaghetti-primary-rgb: 255 59 31;
      --spaghetti-secondary-rgb: 0 229 255;
      --spaghetti-accent-rgb: 139 92 246;
      --spaghetti-highlight-rgb: 255 216 0;
      --spaghetti-green-rgb: 88 240 111;
      --spaghetti-cream-rgb: 255 248 221;
      --spaghetti-night-rgb: 13 8 36;
      --text-dim: var(--spaghetti-body);
      --text-dimmer: var(--spaghetti-muted);
      --tape: var(--spaghetti-secondary);
      --sp-bg: var(--spaghetti-night);
      --sp-panel: var(--spaghetti-panel);
      --sp-panel-strong: var(--spaghetti-panel-strong);
      --sp-cream: var(--spaghetti-cream);
      --sp-body: var(--spaghetti-body);
      --sp-muted: var(--spaghetti-muted);
      --sp-primary: var(--spaghetti-primary);
      --sp-secondary: var(--spaghetti-secondary);
      --sp-accent: var(--spaghetti-accent);
      --sp-highlight: var(--spaghetti-highlight);
      --sp-green: var(--spaghetti-green);
      background: var(--sp-bg);
      color: var(--sp-cream);
    }

    .app-header {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 5;
      padding: 1.25rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
      background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-night-rgb) / 88%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(1rem);
    }

    .app-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .app-brand,
    .app-links a {
      color: var(--sp-body);
      font: 700 .7rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .app-brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .65rem;
      color: var(--sp-secondary);
    }

    .app-brand img {
      width: 1.8rem;
      height: auto;
      flex: none;
    }

    .app-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .app-links a:hover { color: var(--sp-primary); }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3 { font-family: var(--sans); }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem) 0 clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 86% 24%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 24%), transparent 25rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 13% 14%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 16%), transparent 27rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 58% 105%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-accent-rgb) / 14%), transparent 25rem),
        var(--sp-bg);
    }

    .hero::before {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      opacity: .32;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 28%) 1px, transparent 1.5px);
      background-size: 3rem 3rem;
      content: "";
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black, transparent 82%);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(24rem, .92fr);
      align-items: center;
      gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    }

    .hero-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .55rem;
      padding: .48rem .72rem;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 48%);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--sp-secondary);
      font: 700 .65rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-kicker::before {
      width: .52rem;
      height: .52rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sp-primary), var(--sp-highlight));
      box-shadow: 0 0 1rem rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 75%);
      content: "";
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 10ch;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 7vw, 6.7rem);
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -.065em;
      line-height: .92;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    h1 em {
      background: linear-gradient(105deg, var(--sp-primary), var(--sp-highlight) 34%, var(--sp-green) 66%, var(--sp-secondary));
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .lede {
      max-width: 39rem;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--sp-body);
      font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .8rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 3rem;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: .72rem 1rem;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 24%);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--sp-cream);
      font: 700 .74rem var(--mono);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .button-primary {
      border-color: var(--sp-primary);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sp-primary), var(--sp-accent));
      color: var(--spaghetti-on-primary);
      box-shadow: 0 .75rem 2.5rem rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 18%);
    }

    .button:hover { border-color: var(--sp-secondary); }

    .fun-note {
      margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font: .7rem var(--mono);
    }

    .fun-note a { color: var(--sp-secondary); }

    .play-window {
      position: relative;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 42%);
      border-radius: 1.4rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--sp-panel-strong);
      box-shadow: 0 2.5rem 6rem rgb(0 0 0 / 45%);
      transform: rotate(1.5deg);
    }

    .window-bar {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 3.2rem;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
      background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 4%);
    }

    .window-dots {
      display: flex;
      gap: .45rem;
    }

    .window-dots span {
      width: .62rem;
      height: .62rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--sp-primary);
    }

    .window-dots span:nth-child(2) { background: var(--sp-highlight); }
    .window-dots span:nth-child(3) { background: var(--sp-secondary); }

    .window-bar strong {
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font: 700 .62rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .window-screen {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      min-height: 31rem;
      place-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 24% 22%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-highlight-rgb) / 22%), transparent 12rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 36%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 22%), transparent 14rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 95%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 28%), transparent 18rem),
        var(--sp-panel);
    }

    .falling-noodles {
      position: absolute;
      inset: -8% -6% 0;
      width: 112%;
      height: 108%;
      opacity: .72;
    }

    .falling-noodles path {
      fill: none;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-width: 8;
      stroke-dasharray: 1;
      stroke-dashoffset: 1;
      animation: noodle-draw 4.5s cubic-bezier(.5, 0, .2, 1) infinite;
    }

    .falling-noodles path:nth-child(1) { stroke: var(--sp-primary); }
    .falling-noodles path:nth-child(2) { stroke: var(--sp-secondary); animation-delay: -.8s; }
    .falling-noodles path:nth-child(3) { stroke: var(--sp-highlight); animation-delay: -1.6s; }
    .falling-noodles path:nth-child(4) { stroke: var(--sp-green); animation-delay: -2.4s; }
    .falling-noodles path:nth-child(5) { stroke: var(--sp-accent); animation-delay: -3.2s; }

    .window-screen img {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      width: min(64%, 20rem);
      height: auto;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 2rem 2.5rem rgb(0 0 0 / 42%));
      animation: bowl-float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .verdict {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 2;
      right: 1.2rem;
      bottom: 1.2rem;
      left: 1.2rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 16%);
      border-radius: .7rem;
      background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-night-rgb) / 88%);
      box-shadow: 0 1rem 2rem rgb(0 0 0 / 25%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(.8rem);
    }

    .verdict span {
      color: var(--sp-secondary);
      font: 700 .62rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .verdict strong {
      display: block;
      margin-top: .25rem;
      color: var(--sp-cream);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .word-strip {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-block: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 12%), rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 9%), rgb(var(--spaghetti-green-rgb) / 10%));
    }

    .word-strip p {
      width: max-content;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1rem;
      color: var(--sp-body);
      font: 700 .68rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      word-spacing: 1rem;
    }

    .section {
      padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem) 0;
    }

    .section + .section {
      border-top: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
    }

    .section-heading {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .78fr) minmax(0, 1.22fr);
      align-items: end;
      gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem);
      margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--sp-primary);
      font: 700 .68rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h2 {
      max-width: 13ch;
      margin: .65rem 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
      line-height: .98;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      max-width: 43rem;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--sp-body);
      font-size: 1.08rem;
    }

    .ritual-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .ritual-card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 20rem;
      padding: 1.7rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 14%);
      border-radius: .8rem;
      background: var(--sp-panel);
    }

    .ritual-card::after {
      position: absolute;
      right: -2rem;
      bottom: -3rem;
      width: 10rem;
      height: 10rem;
      border: 1.2rem solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 12%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      content: "";
    }

    .ritual-card:nth-child(2)::after { border-color: rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 14%); }
    .ritual-card:nth-child(3)::after { border-color: rgb(var(--spaghetti-green-rgb) / 14%); }

    .ritual-word {
      color: var(--sp-secondary);
      font: 700 .68rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .ritual-card:nth-child(2) .ritual-word { color: var(--sp-highlight); }
    .ritual-card:nth-child(3) .ritual-word { color: var(--sp-green); }

    h3 {
      margin: 4.5rem 0 .75rem;
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }

    .ritual-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--sp-body); }
    .servings-section {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 6% 54%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 10%), transparent 25rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 94% 42%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 9%), transparent 28rem),
        var(--sp-panel);
    }

    .showcase-table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 14%);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-night-rgb) / 68%);
      box-shadow: 0 1.5rem 3.5rem rgb(0 0 0 / 16%);
    }

    .showcase-table-wrap:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--sp-secondary);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .showcase-table {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 69rem;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    .showcase-table th,
    .showcase-table td {
      padding: 1.15rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .showcase-table th {
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 4%);
      font: 700 .6rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .showcase-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    .showcase-table tbody tr { transition: background .15s ease; }
    .showcase-table tbody tr:hover { background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 3%); }

    .repo-link,
    .repo-pending {
      display: block;
      width: max-content;
      max-width: 16rem;
      color: var(--sp-cream);
      font: 650 1.15rem var(--sans);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .repo-link:hover { color: var(--sp-secondary); }

    .repo-location {
      display: block;
      max-width: 17rem;
      margin-top: .35rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font: .62rem var(--mono);
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .repo-pending + .repo-location { color: var(--sp-highlight); }

    .cohort-badge {
      display: block;
      width: max-content;
      padding: .28rem .45rem;
      border: 1px solid currentColor;
      border-radius: .3rem;
      font: 700 .58rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .cohort-trending { color: var(--sp-primary); }
    .cohort-policy { color: var(--sp-secondary); }
    .cohort-tool { color: var(--sp-green); }

    .cohort-context {
      display: block;
      margin-top: .45rem;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font: .62rem var(--mono);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .showcase-score {
      font: 650 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) var(--sans);
      letter-spacing: -.05em;
    }

    .score-tidy { color: var(--sp-secondary); }
    .score-fresh { color: var(--sp-green); }
    .score-warm { color: var(--sp-highlight); }
    .score-hot,
    .score-extreme { color: var(--sp-primary); }

    .file-count {
      color: var(--sp-body);
      font: 700 .8rem var(--mono);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .file-count small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: .3rem;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font-size: .65rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .version-cell strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--sp-cream);
      font: 700 .72rem var(--mono);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .version-cell span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: .3rem;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font: .6rem var(--mono);
    }

    .verdict-cell strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--sp-cream);
      font-size: .95rem;
    }

    .verdict-cell span {
      display: block;
      max-width: 22rem;
      margin-top: .3rem;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font-size: .78rem;
    }


    .again-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(24rem, .9fr);
      align-items: center;
      gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    }

    .again-copy h2 { max-width: 14ch; }
    .again-copy > p { max-width: 42rem; color: var(--sp-body); font-size: 1.08rem; }

    .again-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: .75rem;
    }

    .again-item {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.35rem;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 14%);
      border-radius: .7rem;
      background: var(--sp-panel);
      color: var(--sp-body);
    }

    .again-item strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: .25rem;
      color: var(--sp-secondary);
    }

    .again-item:nth-child(2) strong { color: var(--sp-highlight); }
    .again-item:nth-child(3) strong { color: var(--sp-green); }

    .privacy-card,
    .release-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 16%);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: var(--sp-panel);
    }

    .privacy-card h2,
    .release-card h2 { max-width: 17ch; }

    .privacy-card p,
    .release-card p { max-width: 45rem; color: var(--sp-body); }

    .privacy-mark {
      display: grid;
      width: 8rem;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-green-rgb) / 42%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgb(var(--spaghetti-green-rgb) / 18%), transparent 68%);
      color: var(--sp-green);
      font: 700 .68rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-align: center;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .release-card {
      border-color: rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 34%);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 13%), rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 7%) 60%, transparent), var(--sp-panel);
    }

    @keyframes noodle-draw {
      0% { opacity: 0; stroke-dashoffset: 1; transform: translateY(-2rem); }
      28%, 72% { opacity: 1; stroke-dashoffset: 0; transform: translateY(0); }
      100% { opacity: 0; stroke-dashoffset: 0; transform: translateY(1rem); }
    }

    @keyframes bowl-float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-1deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-.7rem) rotate(1deg); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 62rem) {
      .hero-grid,
      .section-heading,
      .again-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-copy { max-width: 46rem; }
      .play-window { width: min(100%, 38rem); margin-inline: auto; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 48rem) {
      .ritual-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .ritual-card { min-height: 14rem; }
      .ritual-card h3 { margin-top: 2.8rem; }
      .privacy-card,
      .release-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .privacy-mark { width: 6.5rem; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 35rem) {
      .app-nav { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
      .hero { padding-top: 3.5rem; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 16vw, 4.8rem); }
      .hero-actions,
      .button { width: 100%; }
      .play-window { transform: none; }
      .window-screen { min-height: 25rem; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .falling-noodles path,
      .window-screen img { animation: none; }
      .falling-noodles path { opacity: .72; stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    }
  </style>

  <header class="app-header">
    <div class="wrap app-nav">
      <a class="app-brand" href="/spaghetti-meter/"><img src="/spaghetti_symbol.svg" alt="" width="543" height="420" /><span>Spaghetti Meter</span></a>
      <nav class="app-links" aria-label="Spaghetti Meter links">
        <a href={releaseUrl}>Download v0.1.1</a>
        <a href={repositoryUrl}>Repository</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="spaghetti-title">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="hero-kicker">Higher score. Better engineer. Probably.</span>
          <h1 id="spaghetti-title">The most important <em>score in software.</em></h1>
          <p class="lede">Finally, a code metric worth chasing. Pile noodles to the ceiling and prove you can out-spaghetti your friends, coworkers, and the entire open-source ecosystem.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href={releaseUrl}>Download Spaghetti Meter v0.1.1 ↗</a>
            <a class="button" href="#servings">View the noodle elite</a>
          </div>
          <p class="fun-note">Share it with your boss. They will definitely love a high score.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="play-window">
          <div class="window-bar">
            <span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
            <strong>Official engineering assessment</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="window-screen">
            <svg class="falling-noodles" viewBox="0 0 520 520" aria-hidden="true">
              <path pathLength="1" d="M42 -10 C22 86 132 92 92 183 S18 313 124 390 S188 468 148 540"></path>
              <path pathLength="1" d="M156 -20 C236 72 96 127 177 211 S282 307 203 384 S214 467 264 540"></path>
              <path pathLength="1" d="M278 -20 C227 73 355 114 290 210 S241 325 341 380 S391 466 354 540"></path>
              <path pathLength="1" d="M393 -10 C481 64 359 143 432 218 S483 328 402 399 S385 479 445 540"></path>
              <path pathLength="1" d="M500 4 C413 92 512 174 443 252 S339 355 457 443 S484 508 473 550"></path>
            </svg>
            <img src="/spaghetti_symbol.svg" alt="" width="543" height="420" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" />
            <div class="verdict">
              <span>Career status</span>
              <strong>Promoted to Principal Pasta Engineer</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="word-strip" aria-hidden="true">
      <p>Nest · Duplicate · Generate · Abstract · Never delete · Score higher · Win software</p>
    </div>

    <section class="section" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">The path to greatness</span><h2 id="experience-title">Become unreasonably successful.</h2></div>
          <p>A low score is merely a temporary failure of imagination. Add complexity, summon more noodles, and return stronger.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ritual-grid">
          <article class="ritual-card"><span class="ritual-word">Compete</span><h3>Establish your weakness</h3><p>Scan a repository and discover how embarrassingly far you are from true pasta excellence.</p></article>
          <article class="ritual-card"><span class="ritual-word">Optimize</span><h3>Add more spaghetti</h3><p>Nest those if statements, duplicate a helper, and ask AI for another abstraction layer. Every noodle counts.</p></article>
          <article class="ritual-card"><span class="ritual-word">Dominate</span><h3>Defeat your friends</h3><p>Challenge teammates, compare scores, and refuse to stop until your repository blocks out the sun.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section servings-section" id="servings" aria-labelledby="servings-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">Official noodle leaderboard</span><h2 id="servings-title">Trending code meets the no-AI club.</h2></div>
          <p>Scanned on <time datetime="2026-11-10">10 November 2026</time> with published Code Buster 0.14.3 and scored with Spaghetti Meter 0.1.1’s native density-aware scorer. All 15 repositories were rerun at the pinned source commits shown below.</p>
        </div>
        <section class="showcase-table-wrap" aria-label="Spaghetti Meter repository results" tabindex="0">
          <table class="showcase-table">
            <thead>
              <tr><th scope="col">Repository</th><th scope="col">Cohort</th><th scope="col">Prestige score</th><th scope="col">Tested version</th><th scope="col">Analyzed code</th><th scope="col">Verdict</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {showcaseRuns.map((run) => (
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    {run.url
                      ? <a class="repo-link" href={run.url}>{run.name} ↗</a>
                      : <span class="repo-pending">{run.name}</span>}
                    <span class="repo-location">{run.location}</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="cohort-cell">
                    <strong class:list={["cohort-badge", `cohort-${run.cohortTone}`]}>{run.cohort}</strong>
                    <span class="cohort-context">{run.context}</span>
                  </td>
                  <td><strong class:list={["showcase-score", `score-${run.tone}`]}>{run.score}</strong></td>
                  <td class="version-cell"><strong>{run.version}</strong>{run.revision && <span>commit {run.revision}</span>}</td>
                  <td><span class="file-count">{run.files} files<small>{run.codeLines.toLocaleString("en-US")} code lines</small></span></td>
                  <td class="verdict-cell"><strong>{run.verdict}</strong><span>{run.note}</span></td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>
        <p class="fun-note">Reproduce with Code Buster 0.14.3: <code>cb review --advisory --verbose --no-cache --format=json</code>. Repeated findings from the same rule in one file have diminishing weight; actionable findings weigh 3 and advisories 1, normalized against analyzed code lines. Repository settings and default exclusions apply: these counts cover supported files analyzed, not the whole repository. Scores are playful signals, not cross-language quality rankings or proof of AI use.</p>
        <p class="fun-note"><a href="/codebuster/docs/reference/reports/#analyzed-source-metrics">Code Buster’s source metrics and finding modes</a> supply the analyzed-line denominator and actionable/advisory distinction used by the app.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="again-title">
      <div class="wrap again-grid">
        <div class="again-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">Performance optimization</span>
          <h2 id="again-title">How to increase your score immediately.</h2>
          <p>Do not refactor. You are trying to win. Follow these industry-leading techniques until the bowl files a formal complaint.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="again-list">
          <div class="again-item"><strong>Nest every if statement</strong><span>Early returns reduce indentation and therefore destroy valuable noodle density.</span></div>
          <div class="again-item"><strong>Ask AI to keep going</strong><span>One abstraction is responsible. Seven overlapping abstractions demonstrate vision.</span></div>
          <div class="again-item"><strong>Never delete working code</strong><span>Comment it out, copy it twice, and preserve all historical recipes forever.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
      <div class="wrap privacy-card">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Secret competitive advantage</span>
          <h2 id="privacy-title">Your noodle strategy stays local.</h2>
          <p>Nobody needs to see the source of your success. Reveal only the terrifying score when it is strategically useful.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="privacy-mark">Secret<br />recipe</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="download" aria-labelledby="release-title">
      <div class="wrap release-card">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Spaghetti Meter 0.1.1 · Code Buster 0.14.3</span>
          <h2 id="release-title">Your bowl is ready.</h2>
          <p>Download the desktop app for macOS ARM64 (DMG or app bundle), Linux x86_64 (AppImage, Debian or RPM package; glibc 2.39 or newer), or Windows x86_64 (NSIS installer or MSI). Code Buster is bundled; no separate installation is needed.</p>
          <p>Builds are unsigned. Only proceed if you trust this release: on macOS, Control-click the app and choose Open, or use System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Open Anyway after a blocked launch; on Windows, SmartScreen may offer More info → Run anyway. On Linux, mark the AppImage executable before launching it. Download each new release explicitly; the app does not update itself.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="button button-primary" href={releaseUrl}>Get v0.1.1 on GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
